# ============================================================
# STEP 12 — GSE76427 EXTERNAL VALIDATION OF STEP 10
# CORRECTED VERSION
#
# IMPORTANT CORRECTION:
# gse76427_gene_expression is a LIST in the current session.
# This code therefore identifies the actual numeric expression
# matrix among the existing GSE76427 expression objects.
#
# No [[ syntax is used anywhere in this code.
# ============================================================


